('递归计算幂', '给定整数 a 和非负整数 n，请输出 a 的 n 次方，保证结果在 64 位整数范围内。', '["递归","数学"]', '[{"input":"2 10","output":"1024"},{"input":"5 0","output":"1"}]', '[{"language":"java8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"java21","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"python3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"pypy3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"javascript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"typescript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128}]', 0, 0, 1, 1),
('斐波那契递归入门', '请使用递归定义计算斐波那契数列的第 n 项，f(0)=0，f(1)=1。', '["递归","入门"]', '[{"input":"6","output":"8"},{"input":"8","output":"21"}]', '[{"language":"java8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"java21","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"python3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"pypy3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"javascript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"typescript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128}]', 0, 0, 1, 1),
('字符数字转整数', '给定一个只包含数字字符的字符串，请将其转换为整数并输出。', '["字符串","转换"]', '[{"input":"12345","output":"12345"},{"input":"007","output":"7"}]', '[{"language":"java8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"java21","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"python3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"pypy3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"javascript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"typescript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128}]', 0, 0, 1, 1),
('整数转二进制', '给定一个非负整数 n，请输出它的二进制表示，不输出前导零；n=0 时输出 0。', '["数学","进制"]', '[{"input":"10","output":"1010"},{"input":"0","output":"0"}]', '[{"language":"java8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"java21","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"python3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"pypy3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"javascript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"typescript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128}]', 0, 0, 1, 1),
('二进制转整数', '给定一个只包含 0 和 1 的字符串，请输出对应的十进制整数。', '["数学","进制"]', '[{"input":"1010","output":"10"},{"input":"1111","output":"15"}]', '[{"language":"java8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"java21","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"python3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"pypy3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"javascript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"typescript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128}]', 0, 0, 1, 1),
('三角形面积', '给定三角形的底和高，请输出面积，结果保留两位小数。', '["数学","公式"]', '[{"input":"3 4","output":"6.00"},{"input":"5 6","output":"15.00"}]', '[{"language":"java8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"java21","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"python3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"pypy3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"javascript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"typescript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128}]', 0, 0, 1, 1),
('圆的面积', '给定圆的半径 r，请输出圆的面积，使用 pi=3.14，结果保留两位小数。', '["数学","公式"]', '[{"input":"2","output":"12.56"},{"input":"5","output":"78.50"}]', '[{"language":"java8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"java21","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"python3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"pypy3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"javascript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"typescript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128}]', 0, 0, 1, 1),
('温度转换', '给定摄氏温度 C，请输出对应的华氏温度 F=9*C/5+32，结果保留两位小数。', '["数学","公式"]', '[{"input":"0","output":"32.00"},{"input":"100","output":"212.00"}]', '[{"language":"java8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"java21","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"python3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"pypy3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"javascript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"typescript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128}]', 0, 0, 1, 1),
('闰年判断', '给定年份 y，能被 400 整除或能被 4 整除但不能被 100 整除时是闰年。是则输出 Yes，否则输出 No。', '["数学","分支"]', '[{"input":"2024","output":"Yes"},{"input":"1900","output":"No"}]', '[{"language":"java8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"java21","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"python3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"pypy3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"javascript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"typescript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128}]', 0, 0, 1, 1),
('星期判断', '给定 1 到 7 的整数 d，请输出对应星期名称，1 为 Monday，2 为 Tuesday，依次类推，7 为 Sunday。', '["分支","入门"]', '[{"input":"1","output":"Monday"},{"input":"7","output":"Sunday"}]', '[{"language":"java8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"java21","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"python3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"pypy3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"javascript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"typescript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128}]', 0, 0, 1, 1),
('零钱兑换', '有 1 元、5 元和 10 元硬币，给定金额 n，请输出兑换该金额所需的最少硬币数。', '["贪心","数学"]', '[{"input":"18","output":"5"},{"input":"7","output":"3"}]', '[{"language":"java8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"java21","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"gcc9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++7","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++8","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"g++9","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"python3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"pypy3","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"javascript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128},{"language":"typescript","timeLimit":1000,"memoryLimit":128}]', 0, 0, 1, 1),
